                    },
                    "message": "We should open a task to phosphor-pid-control and reference that here.  We see a clear fd leak in it.\n\nIf you don't do that, I can.  Marking as -1 so that we get the commit message and code updated with a reference to the pending (but not yet created) task."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eric Yang",
                        "email": "eric.yang.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                        "username": "fornchu110"
                    },
                    "message": "I understand that this is a short-term workaround and needs to be tracked.\nOnce the file descriptor (FD) leak in phosphor PID is fixed, this workaround should be removed.\n\nHowever, I would like to ask for clarification: when you mentioned \"task,\" are you referring to creating a new Jira task and linking it to this Gerrit change?\n\nThank you for your suggestion."
                },
