                        "email": "eric.yang.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                        "username": "fornchu110"
                    },
                    "message": "I just discovered that after trying to change the fan table to the latest version required by the thermal team for testing, need to set the phosphor-pid-control's LimitNOFILE to 65536 in order for phosphor-pid-control to function properly."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Pete O_o",
                        "email": "pmb@meta.com",
                        "username": "waffle2k"
                    },
                    "message": "Plus 1'ing this. The comments are in that this is a temp remediation and I don't want to block on the task part. I'll be sure to follow up on that but it's important to WW to get this change into their image."
                }
